p.src:
Let us verify the spectrum of the pure-state projector. Normalization gives $\rho_\psi\ket{\psi}
=\ket{\psi}\braket{\psi}{\psi}
=\ket{\psi},$ so $\ket{\psi}$ is an eigenvector with eigenvalue $1$. If $\ket{\phi}$ is orthogonal to $\ket{\psi}$, then $\rho_\psi\ket{\phi}
=\ket{\psi}\braket{\psi}{\phi}
=0.$ Every direction orthogonal to $\ket{\psi}$ therefore has eigenvalue zero.

