=\ket{\psi}\braket{\psi}{\phi}
=0.$ 因此，每个与$\ket{\psi}$正交的方向都具有本征值零。

p.src:
The most general pure state of the pair is $\ket{\Psi}
=\sum_{a,b}\psi(a,b)\ket{a,b},
\qquad
\sum_{a,b}|\psi(a,b)|^2=1.$ Now let Alice measure an observable $M_A$ that acts only on subsystem $A$. On the composite Hilbert space the operator is $M_A\otimes I_B$. Its matrix elements are $\bra{a',b'}M_A\otimes I_B\ket{a,b}
=\bra{a'}M_A\ket{a}\,\delta_{b'b}.$ The $B$ label is passive.

